			"notes": "# Additions\nNew Advancements:\n- Goose on the Loose\n\tUses new `lead_snaps` criterion\n- Varied Dairy\n- Oresome\n\nNew Music Disc: \"Evening Shifts\", dropped by Creepers killed by Witches. Required for \"It's a New Record!\"\n\n# Changes\nSome gamerules have different defaults now.\n\nHaving the Oozing effect now gives extra particles inside Slime Chunks.\nHaving the Blindness effect now gives particles hinting at the location of Ancient Cities.\n\nPhantoms are no longer spawned from insomnia by Players in Creative.\n\nBeacons now break faster when a Pickaxe is used.\n\nThe default Egg is now called \"Pale Egg\".\nThe message for trying to build above the world height is now more vague.\n\n`/platform` now considers gamerule `max_block_modifications`.\n\nZombies now very rarely spawn with Player Heads."
		},
