			"notes": "# Update to MC 1.21.11\n\nYou will need the Fabric Loader [(get here)](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/), and a template `mods` folder is included with this release.\n\n## Mod v1.7.1\nNew Advancements:\n- 22 Soldiers\n- Ripped Genes\n\nNew Block:\n- Gabbro, `echotweaks:fake_bedrock`\n\nNew Statistic Type:\n- `echotweaks.bred` for per-mob tracking\n\nVanilla Change:\n- The Blue Axolotl mutation becomes more common as more Axolotls are bred\n(each breed only increases the chance for that player)\n\nChanged Advancements:\n- _It's a New Record_ now requires Music Discs: \n\t- \"Tears\"\n\t- \"Lava Chicken\"\n- _One with the Wild_ now requires:\n\t- Building each Golem type (Iron, Snow, Copper)\n\t- Riding the Happy Ghast\n\t- All of the Mounts of Mayhem creatures (Camel Husk, Nautilus, Zombie Nautilus, Zombie Horse)"
		},
