			"notes": "# Update to MC 1.21.10!\n> Goodbye, 1.21.5. You will be miss...ssing your features when I cherry-pick them as I see fit.\n\nYou will need the Fabric Loader [(get here)](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/), and a template `mods` folder is included with this release.\n\n## Mod v1.7.0\nNew Advancements:\n- Conga Line\n- It's a New Record!\n- You Monster\n- Zoology (root)\n- A Cacophonous Chorus\n- A Dense Octette\n- One with the Wild\n- Rein Check\n- Spitting Image\n\nChanges to vanilla:\n- Total Beelocation now works with Beehives"
		},
